	"Author": "Tooma8",
	"AuthorLabel": "Tooma8Channel[GD]",
	"TagLine": "Let's you change Mr. Qi's skin color. Also has a option for randomized skin color each day. ",
	"Description": "This is my first attempt at making a SMAPI mod/content pack for Stardew Valley. It lets you edit Mr. Qi's skin color to 6 different colors. It also has a option for a randomized skin color each day.\n\nConfiguration:\n\"QiColor\" - Let's you choose Mr. Qi's skin color\nOptions:\n\"Blue\" (vanilla)\n\"Red\"\n\"Orange\"\n\"Yellow\"\n\"Green\"\n\"Purple\"\n\n\"RandomColor\" - Let's you toggle daily randomized skin color\nOptions:\n\"On\"\n\"Off\"\n\nPlease let me know if you find any problems!\n\nCharacter and portrait edits created by me in PixieEngine",
